{
  "title": "Yeasty Crunchy Indian Mirin-Hon Idli",
  "description": "A light and crispy idli recipe with the unique flavor of mirin-hon and yuzu-cure, perfect for a low-calorie breakfast or snack.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
